  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 122,
    "summary": "David says, Go into the house of the Lord—Give thanks unto Him.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "I was glad when they said unto me, Let us go into the house of the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 54,
            "end": 59,
            "text": "Ezra 2:68; 2 Ne. 12:3 (2–3); D&C 133:13 (12–14). TG Genealogy and Temple Work."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Our feet shall stand within thy gates, O Jerusalem.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Jerusalem is builded as a city that is compact together:",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Whither the tribes go up, the tribes of the Lord, unto the testimony of Israel, to give thanks unto the name of the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 50,
            "end": 71,
            "text": "OR as a testimony for."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For there are set thrones of judgment, the thrones of the house of David.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Pray for the peace of Jerusalem: they shall prosper that love thee.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 13,
            "end": 18,
            "text": "TG Peace."
          },
          {
            "start": 44,
            "end": 51,
            "text": "Jarom 1:9; Mosiah 1:7; Alma 37:13."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Peace be within thy walls, and prosperity within thy palaces.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 27,
            "end": 30
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For my brethren and companions’ sakes, I will now say, Peace be within thee.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 55,
            "end": 60,
            "text": "1 Sam. 25:6."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 61,
            "end": 63
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Because of the house of the Lord our God I will seek thy good.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
  },
